        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Introducing The Hazel (House Type F) – A beautifully designed three-bedroom semi-detached home extending to approximately 107.5 sq.m (1,157 sq.ft).\r\n\r\nThis thoughtfully laid-out home combines modern design with energy efficiency, making it ideal for comfortable, contemporary living.\r\n\r\nEligible purchasers may benefit from a range of Government-backed initiatives available at Droim an Óir, including:\r\n\r\nThe Help to Buy Scheme, offering up to €30,000 towards your deposit\r\nThe First Home Scheme, providing support of up to 30% of the purchase price\r\nCompetitive Green Mortgages, with lower interest rates available for energy-efficient homes\r\nThese schemes are designed to make homeownership more accessible and affordable for first-time buyers and other eligible purchasers.\r\n\r\n  Register your interest today to stay up to date with the latest information."
